 while programs can vary.","short_summary":"A downtown arts center with free gallery admission.","evidence_claim":"The Dahl Arts Center is at 713 7th Street, has five visual-art galleries, and states that admission is always free with a suggested donation.","source_url":"https://www.thedahl.org/","source_title":"Dahl Arts Center","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Dahl lists Monday–Saturday, 10 a.m.–5 p.m.; some classes and performances may be ticketed.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"art-alley-sixth-seventh-streets","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Art Alley","title":"Art Alley","subtitle":"Sixth–Seventh Street corridor, between Main and Saint Joseph","notes":"Enter the working alley from the downtown street grid and photograph the changing murals without blocking deliveries, doors, or service traffic.","short_summary":"An evolving outdoor mural corridor in downtown Rapid City.","evidence_claim":"Art Alley is a free, family-friendly community gallery between 6th and 7th Streets and Main and Saint Joseph Streets, with changing wall art.","source_url":"https://www.visitrapidcity.com/listing/art-alley/495/","source_title":"Art Alley","source_kind":"other_reliable","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"It remains a functioning alley; give vehicles and businesses clear access.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"city-of-presidents-main-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"City of Presidents","title":"City of Presidents","subtitle":"Main Street downtown corridor","notes":"Use the free mobile or dial-in guide to locate the downtown presidential statues, then choose a section of the route that fits your available walking time.","short_summary":"A self-guided downtown route of presidential statues.","evidence_claim":"The City of Presidents offers a free mobile tour with an interactive map, statue directory, and audio narration, plus a free dial-in option.","source_url":"https://www.visitrapidcity.com/things-to-do/historic-sites/city-of-presidents/","source_title":"City of Presidents","source_kind":"other_reliable","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The statues are distributed across downtown; the visitor center offers printed guides during its seasonal operation.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
